{
  "description": "",
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nRequest rate, error rate, and p95 latency for the local model service.\n\nWhy you care:\nThis is the first check for infrastructure incidents.\n\nHow to read it:\nHealthy traffic and latency with rising behavior change points away from infrastructure.\n\nWhat to do next:\nIf this looks normal, inspect behavior, inputs, outputs, and deploy timing.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_errors_total",
          "metricchrono_ai_request_duration_seconds",
          "metricchrono_ai_requests_total"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "short"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(metricchrono_ai_requests_total{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\"}[$window]))",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "Request rate",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(metricchrono_ai_errors_total{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\"}[$window]))",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "Error rate",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(metricchrono_ai_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\"}[$window])))",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "p95 latency",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Is the service healthy?",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nHow far current model behavior has moved from normal baseline behavior.\n\nWhy you care:\nLabels and business outcomes often arrive late. This can show behavior movement earlier.\n\nHow to read it:\nLow is normal. Rising means behavior is moving. A sharp spike after a deploy suggests a regression or rollout effect.\n\nWhat to do next:\nCheck the inputs-versus-outputs panel and the changed-stream table.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "percent"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",comparison=\"normal_baseline\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "Current behavior vs normal baseline",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Is model behavior changing?",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nBehavior movement split into small, medium, and large changes.\n\nWhy you care:\nSmall-only movement often indicates noise. Large movement suggests a meaningful behavior shift.\n\nHow to read it:\nSmall should dominate during noise. Large should appear near the model-change period.\n\nWhat to do next:\nIf large movement appears, inspect deploy timing and top changed streams.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "id": 3,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_change_score_by_size"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "percent"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (change_size) (metricchrono_ai_change_score_by_size{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",stream=\"overall.behavior\",comparison=\"normal_baseline\",change_size=~\"$change_size\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{change_size}} change",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Is this small noise or a major shift?",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nInput change means the model is seeing different data. Output change means the model is responding differently.\n\nWhy you care:\nThis separates data drift from prediction or output drift.\n\nHow to read it:\nInputs should rise first during gradual drift. Outputs rise later and during the deploy-like change.\n\nWhat to do next:\nInspect the higher line first.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "id": 4,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_input_change_score",
          "metricchrono_ai_output_change_score"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "percent"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(metricchrono_ai_input_change_score{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",comparison=\"normal_baseline\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "Inputs",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(metricchrono_ai_output_change_score{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",comparison=\"normal_baseline\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "Outputs",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "What changed: inputs or outputs?",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nModel-version state beside behavior change.\n\nWhy you care:\nDeploy-correlated behavior changes are common rollback and rollout questions.\n\nHow to read it:\nIf behavior jumps immediately after v2 becomes active, inspect the new version first.\n\nWhat to do next:\nCompare this with the model-version bar chart on the investigation dashboard.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "id": 5,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score",
          "metricchrono_ai_model_version_active"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "none"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (model_version) (metricchrono_ai_model_version_active{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{model_version}} active",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",comparison=\"previous_model_version\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "Behavior after deploy",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Did this start after a deploy?",
      "type": "state-timeline"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nStreams ranked by behavior movement and suggested next step.\n\nWhy you care:\nThis shortens triage by pointing to the first place to inspect.\n\nHow to read it:\nHigher rows changed more. Use the suggested next step as the next debugging action.\n\nWhat to do next:\nOpen the investigation dashboard for details on the top row.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "id": 6,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_inspection_candidate"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [
          "stream",
          "workload",
          "model_version",
          "behavior_change_score",
          "input_change_score",
          "output_change_score",
          "drift_state",
          "next_step"
        ],
        "unitMarking": "percent"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(8, max by (stream,workload,model_version,main_change,cause,next_step,drift_state) (max_over_time(metricchrono_ai_inspection_candidate{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\"}[$__range])))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "changed stream",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Which stream changed most?",
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nBehavior change compared with a delayed synthetic quality proxy.\n\nWhy you care:\nThis shows whether behavior movement can appear before labels or feedback fully arrive.\n\nHow to read it:\nBehavior rising before the quality proxy drops demonstrates early warning.\n\nWhat to do next:\nIf behavior rises first, inspect streams before waiting for labels.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "id": 7,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score",
          "metricchrono_ai_quality_proxy"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "percent"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",comparison=\"normal_baseline\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "Behavior change",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "avg(metricchrono_ai_quality_proxy{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "Quality proxy",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Is quality dropping too?",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "What this shows:\nA simple behavior state for the current service and model.\n\nWhy you care:\nOperators need one summary before they decide whether to act.\n\nHow to read it:\n0 is Normal, 1 is Watch, 2 is Drift, and 3 is Incident.\n\nWhat to do next:\nIf this is Watch or higher, use the investigation dashboard.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 16,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "id": 8,
      "mcRecipe": {
        "expectedMetrics": [
          "metricchrono_ai_drift_state"
        ],
        "tableColumns": [],
        "unitMarking": "none"
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max(metricchrono_ai_drift_state{service=\"$service\",environment=\"$environment\",model=\"$model\",stream=\"overall.behavior\",comparison=\"normal_baseline\"})",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Status",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Current status?",
      "type": "stat"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "5s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "ai-observability",
    "mlops",
    "metricchrono",
    "recipe"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "name": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "type": "datasource"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "checkout-ai",
          "value": "checkout-ai"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "name": "service",
        "query": "label_values(metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score, service)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "local",
          "value": "local"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "name": "environment",
        "query": "label_values(metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score, environment)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "recommendation-ranker",
          "value": "recommendation-ranker"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "name": "model",
        "query": "label_values(metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score, model)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "v2",
          "value": "v2"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "name": "model_version",
        "query": "label_values(metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score, model_version)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "model_service",
          "value": "model_service"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "name": "workload",
        "query": "label_values(metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score, workload)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "overall.behavior",
          "value": "overall.behavior"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "name": "stream",
        "query": "label_values(metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score, stream)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "normal_baseline",
          "value": "normal_baseline"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "name": "comparison",
        "query": "label_values(metricchrono_ai_behavior_change_score, comparison)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "allValue": "small|medium|large",
        "current": {
          "text": "small|medium|large",
          "value": "small|medium|large"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "name": "change_size",
        "query": "small,medium,large",
        "type": "custom"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "30s",
          "value": "30s"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "name": "window",
        "query": "30s,1m,2m,5m",
        "type": "custom"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-2m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "AI Behavior Overview",
  "uid": "ai-behavior-overview",
  "version": 1
}
